1
00:00:00,402 --> 00:00:01,872
(Penny:)Well, here's your key.

2
00:00:01,937 --> 00:00:03,237
(Raj:)Thank you.

3
00:00:03,305 --> 00:00:04,875
(Sheldon:)Enjoy having the place
to yourselves.

4
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:08,580
(Leonard:)You enjoy your mission to boldly
go where no man has gone before.

5
00:00:11,013 --> 00:00:12,513
(Sheldon:)It's Penny's bedroom.

6
00:00:12,581 --> 00:00:14,451
(Sheldon:)Plenty of men have gone before.

7
00:00:17,519 --> 00:00:20,959
(Penny:)Now, now, there's no need
to make this emotional.

8
00:00:21,023 --> 00:00:23,863
(Amy:)Shall we?

9
00:00:23,926 --> 00:00:25,996
(Sheldon:)I guess this is it.

10
00:00:26,061 --> 00:00:26,861
(Leonard:)You guys have fun.

11
00:00:26,929 --> 00:00:29,359
(Sheldon:)You, too.

12
00:00:30,232 --> 00:00:32,302
(Sheldon:)Oh, don't forget.

13
00:00:32,367 --> 00:00:34,807
(Sheldon:)Tuesday the air filters
need to be changed.

14
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:36,540
(Penny:)Yeah, you wrote it on my hand.

15
00:00:36,605 --> 00:00:37,705
(Penny:)Oh.

16
00:00:39,274 --> 00:00:40,574
(Sheldon:)Oh, and every other day,

17
00:00:40,642 --> 00:00:43,012
(Sheldon:)check the water level
on the avocado pit.

18
00:00:43,078 --> 00:00:44,248
(Leonard:)I'm on it.

19
00:00:44,313 --> 00:00:47,253
(Leonard:)15 years from now, we'll
make guacamole together.

20
00:00:47,316 --> 00:00:49,316
(Sheldon:)Leonard, please, let me go.

21
00:00:54,690 --> 00:00:56,620
(Amy:)Come on, Sheldon.

22
00:00:56,692 --> 00:00:58,322
(Sheldon:)Oh. Bye.

23
00:00:58,393 --> 00:01:04,023
- Good night.
- Good night.

